100
00:05:52,580 --> 00:05:58,020
If you're doing a long-haul flight and so basically, so this is what I do.

101
00:05:58,100 --> 00:06:03,940
Since Pakistan doesn't get direct flights from neither the US nor the UK, there is always a connection.

102
00:06:04,020 --> 00:06:05,440
And the first connection is always long.

103
00:06:05,520 --> 00:06:10,240
Whether it's London to Dubai or Dallas to Houston to Dubai. It's always long.

104
00:06:10,320 --> 00:06:16,840
And because there's a layover of 2-3-4 hours, there's no hurry to get out of the plane.

105
00:06:16,920 --> 00:06:22,710
So I always choose the last seat. Why? 86, 87, whatever.

106
00:06:22,790 --> 00:06:26,530
That gives you an advantage point.

107
00:06:26,610 --> 00:06:30,640
You can see the entire section.

108
00:06:30,720 --> 00:06:32,720
Which row is going empty.

109
00:06:32,820 --> 00:06:38,340
As people are getting on board, you can see that the 4th row is empty, the 3rd row is empty.

110
00:06:38,420 --> 00:06:43,500
And you can tell that the door is about to close. Most likely people have arrived. Many people have arrived.

111
00:06:43,580 --> 00:06:49,037
So whenever I feel that this has happened, for example, what happened this time,

112
00:06:49,117 --> 00:06:51,700
the front row of the 4th row was empty.

113
00:06:51,780 --> 00:06:56,900
So I never put my pouch on the corner of the 1st row, neither here nor there.

114
00:06:56,980 --> 00:07:00,450
Because when there is a gap of two seats, anyone would be like, there are three people.

115
00:07:00,530 --> 00:07:03,450
It's better for me to sit here alone than to be trapped by these people.

116
00:07:03,530 --> 00:07:05,450
Right? So he will come and take over.

117
00:07:05,530 --> 00:07:08,450
Now, if he doesn't have enough legs and you straighten his legs, he will get hurt.

118
00:07:08,530 --> 00:07:09,450
So that's not right either.

119
00:07:09,530 --> 00:07:11,450
So never take over the corner.

120
00:07:11,530 --> 00:07:14,450
In the middle, like, like, at number two or number three.

121
00:07:14,530 --> 00:07:20,450
That discourages people because, man, he's close from here and he's close from here. Sort of.

122
00:07:20,530 --> 00:07:26,310
